==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Boxten is a purple music box with a darker purple lid. A silver clasp, with two lighter lines across it to make it appear shiny, seals the lid shut on the front; an also shiny, silver turning key is on the back of his head, on top of a circular, dark purple base. Each edge of the box's sides, other than the lid, is lined with light purple—on the corners, where the lines meet, there are short light purple lines facing inward. He wears a sleeveless, dark purple shirt and a {{TI|Blue Bandana|name=true}} around his neck. His tights are the same blue with two darker stripes.
|-|Vintage Boxten=
Vintage Boxten is now dark gray with lighter gray lining and also has eyes pie-cut on his right. His lid, key base, and shirt are deeper gray, while his bandana and pants are white, with the latter's stripes being black.
|-|Cloudy Dream=
Cloudy Dream Boxten is light purple with a dark lid and key base, silver parts recolored white, and lighter lining. He has two white clouds decorated on each of his non-lid sides, with the face having smaller, puffier cheek-like clouds. He wears a short-sleeved, pale turquoise shirt with darker pinstripes and bow-shaped lapels underneath a box pleat in the center that has two white buttons. Instead of tights, wears dark teal shorts, making legs visible which now have has white, cloud-like markings on the feet.
|-|Passionate Wisteria=
Passionate Wisteria Boxten is a light lavender color with a darker lid and lining, the lining having white hearts outlined with the darker purple, in place of the lines. His silver parts are slightly more darkish-purple compared the lid and lining, and its shine lines are pink. The base his key rests on his reddish-pink. He wears a reddish-pink shirt with a darker polka-dot pattern, hem, and pair lengthy sleeves. His bandana is the purplish shade of his silver parts and is decorated with pink clovers and white dots. His tights have a darkish-purple color with a pink gradient on the lower half, and the stripes, now colored white, are directly above and below his knees.
|-|Creepy Chord=
Creepy Chord Boxten has a wavy cat-like smile, slightly more saturated shades of purple, and silver parts with a more brass-like color. He also wears a two-tailed, yellow scarf with darker, orangish stripes, and a burnt orange, long-sleeved shirt with the design of a light orange jack-o'-lantern face. His tights are black, and he wears yellow socks with darker, orangish toes and heels.
|-|Quiet Caroler=
Quiet Caroler Boxten is a faded maroon color with a darker lid and base, lighter lining, and round, red cheeks. His silver parts are also now recolored golden. He wears a white sweater with black cuffs, and a design of two black stripes across the center of the body and sleeves, along with a black beamed eighth note on the front and back. Instead of a bandana, he wears a fern green scarf with a red stripe slightly above the tail, which hangs from the left of his back. His tights are also now colored black, and he wears fern green boots with white, fuzzy collar lining and red soles.
|-|Winged Chords=
Winged Chords Boxten is periwinkle colored with darker lines, even darker pairs of three freckles, and a white lid and key base, while his silver components are now pastel yellow. He wears a puffy, long sleeved shirt the same color as his lining with a lighter clover-like pattern and a "V"-shaped collar colored dark like his freckles. A white cloth can also be seen underneath. He has light yellow butterflies with darker wing borders and black antennae varying in size, with a large one on the top right corner of his face, three small ones on the right side of his right eye, near the bottom right corner on the backside of his head, and one on his white cloth, along with two medium-sized ones beside the freckles on his left cheek and near the top left corner of his head's backside. He wears dark periwinkle shorts, and his tights are white with a pastel yellow stripe above the knees.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Boxten is an uncertain and somewhat shy [[Toon]] that is easily frightened, seen in his dialogue with {{CI|Connie|name=true}} and {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}'s gossip. He shows pessimism toward himself and his capabilities when finishing [[Machines]], but is encouraging towards others, although he lacks assertiveness and backs down easily. When he speaks, he often has a stutter and is written using a lot of ellipses. To add onto this anxious nature, his sleep is troubled due to frequent nightmares, and he suspects {{CI|Astro|name=true}} may be the one to blame for them.

Aside from this, Boxten is a big fan of {{CI|Vee|name=true}} because of her gameshow, as he loves trivia. He is close to {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}, as well as {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}, who is teaching him how to bake. His interaction with {{CI|Sprout|name=true}} implies they may be friends, too, and his interaction with {{CI|Toodles|name=true}} implies the same of {{CI|Poppy|name=true}}.

